# Resource identity

Scope: `implesia-mart-backend` only.

Get, update, and delete use the resource UUID. The path is `/{id}`.

```text
GET /api/v1/products/{id}
GET /api/v1/admin/products/{id}
```

Do not add `/{slug}`, `/by-slug/`, or any other lookup key. A non-UUID path is `422`.

`slug` may be stored as unique display metadata. It is optional on create, generated when omitted, and immutable after create. It is never the key for a route.

A public read of a missing id and a hidden id returns the same `404` body. Do not confirm that a hidden record exists.
